  "description": "An opinionated ASP.NET Core Web API starter for .NET. A single AddGMAPI/UseGMAPI pair wires up controllers, CORS, API versioning, Swagger docs, FluentValidation, Serilog, and middlewares for exception handling, request logging (with sensitive-data masking) and request localization. Loads secrets into configuration from a local appsecrets.json or the store the SECRETS_PROVIDER environment variable names (Doppler, AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault, HashiCorp Vault). Bundles the GM.API.* companion packages.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
